[b][c-g][/b] 	Coincide con uno de los caracteres del rango (&quot;[c-g]&quot; coincide con un &#250;nico &quot;c&quot; o &quot;d&quot; o &quot;e&quot; o &quot;f&quot; o &quot;g&quot;.[br]
